// ===========================================================================
// English — every word the Studio says
//
// House rules, from PRODUCT.md and the design answers of 22 Sep 2026:
//
//   * Plain words. Never "token", "session", "authenticate", "TOTP", "rebase",
//     "revision", "commit". The Studio says "signed out", "2-step", "backup
//     codes", "bring up to date".
//   * A control names its action ("Submit for review"), and an error names the
//     problem and the way out of it.
//   * Every state has a NAME here as well as a stroke on screen, because the
//     board never asks anyone to read colour.
//
// ar.ts is typed against this file, so a key added here and forgotten there is
// a compile error rather than a blank label in production.
// ===========================================================================

